  "job_B8.5.4.1_20251003_114912": {
    "chunk_text": "And \u00fea scytan he dyde \u00fea on an gylden f\u00e6t and hyt myd hys hringe geinseglode and \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Swa Ac ic wat, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea het Pilatum \u00feam fulestan dea\u00f0e acwylman and w\u00e6s hym sy\u00f0\u00f0an toweard hys And \u00fe\u00e6t arwur\u00f0e wyf \u00fea Veronix ealle hyre \u00e6hta for Crystes naman forlet and w\u00e6s Volosiane Ac Volosianus hyre to cw\u00e6\u00f0: La wyf, hw\u00e6t secest \u00feu? Heo hym andswarode and cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ic sece mynne dryhten, and la, hw\u00e6t h\u00e6bbe ic gedon, ic axie \u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6t To so\u00f0on ic \u00fee secge, gif \u00feu hyne nelt me agyfan, ne forl\u00e6te ic n\u00e6fre \u00fee, \u00e6r\u00feon \u00f0e ic geseo, hwar \u00feu \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrde, hu Veronix \u00fe\u00e6t arwur\u00f0e wyf gespecen h\u00e6fde, hig sona ealle hyre Ac Veronix heom to cw\u00e6\u00f0: La Hierusalemes bearn, ne wepon ge na ofer me, ac wepa\u00f0 ofer eow and Volosianus \u00fea het hys scypmen swy\u00f0e for\u00f0 rowan and \u00fe\u00e6r b\u00e6ftan let Titum and Vespasianum and And Tyberius \u00fea w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e geblyssigende and het Volosianum hym ra\u00f0e to cuman and hyne sona Ic \u00fee bydde, gebycna hyt ealle me. Volosianus \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0: La myn hlaford, ealle \u00fea \u00f0yng, \u00fee ic \u00fe\u00e6r gemette, ealle ic gedo, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hig nu \u00d0\u00e6t ys \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6r gemette Tytum and Vespasianum \u00feyne",
